+
+## Session expiry
+
+Each saved session records an `issued_at` timestamp. Sessions expire after `SESSION_TTL`
+(3600 seconds, one hour); restoring an older session raises `InvalidSession`. Every restore
+also calls `purge_expired()`, which deletes expired entries from the on-disk cache.
